      "source": "Class for creating Consumer callbacks around prompt list changed consumer methods.\n\nThis class provides a way to convert methods annotated with\n<a href=\"../../../McpPromptListChanged.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.ai.mcp.annotation\"><code>McpPromptListChanged</code></a> into callback functions that can be used to handle prompt\nlist change notifications. It supports methods with a single\nList&lt;McpSchema.Prompt&gt; parameter.",
